---
layout: base.njk
---
<article class="reading">
  <p class="crumb"><a href="/finance/">← 勇博開講</a></p>
  {% if draft %}<p class="draft-banner">這是草稿，只有你在本機預覽看得到。確認沒問題後，刪掉檔案裡的 <code>draft: true</code> 就會發布。</p>{% endif %}
  <header class="reading-head">
    <p class="kind">勇博開講・{{ format or ("影片" if youtube else "筆記") }}・<time datetime="{{ page.date | isoDate }}">{{ page.date | ymd }}</time></p>
    <h1>{{ title }}</h1>
    {% if summary %}<p class="lead">{{ summary }}</p>{% endif %}
  </header>
  {% if youtube %}
  <div class="video{% if vertical %} vertical{% endif %}"><iframe src="https://www.youtube-nocookie.com/embed/{{ youtube }}" title="{{ title }}" loading="lazy" allow="accelerometer; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; fullscreen" allowfullscreen referrerpolicy="strict-origin-when-cross-origin"></iframe></div>
  {% endif %}
  <div class="prose">{{ content | safe }}</div>
  {% include "ad.njk" %}
  <p class="note-disclaimer">本內容僅供學習與資訊整理，不構成任何投資建議，也不推薦買賣特定標的。投資有風險，請自行判斷並以官方資料為準。</p>
</article>
